WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.490
Do you believe that only the Earth is flat,
then?

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:05.490
What about the other planets?

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:11.340
The thing about people who believe the Earth
is flat is that it's not actually a belief

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.240
that the Earth is flat.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:18.869
It's actually just an assertion about doubting
everything that exists.

00:00:18.869 --> 00:00:21.380
Everything we know; science, institutions.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:25.250
I did a big, deep dive on this and learned
a lot about Flat Earthers.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.640
And yeah, there are some people doing science
about it, whatever.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:35.340
But most people are doing the Flat Earth thing
as just a big F-you to science that they can't

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.270
see and understand and measure themselves.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.440
And so they just doubt it.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.820
And it feels really good for them.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.430
And so that's why these arguments don't really
go anywhere.

